        "TileImage": "$($repository b942c2a5-99e5-46a7-a2b1-017ae56864cf).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, Agent Soders. You have two targets tonight - Cilas Netzke and Jasper Knight. Jasper Knight is an American attempting to defect to the Soviets, and Cilas Netzke is assisting in said defection. Netzke happens to have aided other defectors, and the client wants him taken out to prevent him from helping anyone else. To prevent any risks of an international accident, you cannot be spotted doing anything suspect. I will leave you to prepare.",
